WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.026
Every server needs a kitchen.

00:00:03.876 --> 00:00:07.731
Meet Dzbanek. The Discord bot that keeps it warm.

00:00:08.581 --> 00:00:14.792
Drop a song. YouTube, Spotify, whole playlists. Playing in about two seconds.

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:21.710
Or tune in live. Kiss, Rock, or Beat, with the song on air, always up to date.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.628
One living Kitchen Board holds the stereo, the deals, and Friday's Radio Night vote.

00:00:29.478 --> 00:00:36.288
Every morning, ten Steam deals worth your time. And Epic's free games, the moment they drop.

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:42.516
Every new face gets a welcome. Welcome to the dark side. We have cookies.

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:49.551
Dzbanek. Music, radio, deals. Type slash help, and pull up a chair.
